# Full M5 KO arc: five left casts fell the right wizard, a sixth bolt
# fizzles at the corpse's doorstep, the replacement walks in and casts back.
# Right presses NOTHING until after the respawn, so no deflects; left holds
# are 15 ticks (shield is defender-side only, so left's own ward is inert).
#
# Timing (edge E -> spawn E+10 -> doorstep E+68 -> impact E+70):
#   press 10/90/170/250/330 -> impacts 80/160/240/320/400, right hp 5->0.
#   KO during tick 400: COLLAPSE 12 (to 411) -> DOWNED 25 (to 436) ->
#   MEDIC 25 (to 461) -> REPLACE 20 (to 481, variant -> 1) -> ACTIVE at 482.
#   press 400 (same tick as the KO): spawn 410, reaches the doorstep
#   (u=240) during tick 468 -> FIZZLE mid-REPLACE, hp stays 0. (KO+69 is the
#   earliest a follow-up full flight can arrive, which is always in REPLACE.)
#   press R 490 (replacement active since 478, cooldown was cleared at the
#   collapse): spawn 500 at u=247 flying left — still mid-flight at @520 end,
#   deliberately unresolved; t5_replay_golden asserts it is in the air.
version 1
seed 42
@10  press   L 2 3
@25  release L 2 3
@90  press   L 2 3
@105 release L 2 3
@170 press   L 2 3
@185 release L 2 3
@250 press   L 2 3
@265 release L 2 3
@330 press   L 2 3
@345 release L 2 3
@400 press   L 2 3
@415 release L 2 3
@490 press   R 1 4
@505 release R 1 4
@520 end
